# Environment for mining hard negatives for the synthetic PolQA set with
# ~/work/speakleash/mine-hard-negatives (two-stage sdadas flow). Exported by
# scripts/synth_mine.sh; python-decouple reads the process environment before
# that project's own .env, so nothing there is touched.
